            "review_text": "David F\nUtrecht, The Netherlands2 contributions\n0\nBreakfast\nFeb 2019 • Couples\nMy wife ate the pho which was without flavor, my full English breakfast was even worse. I hope it’s because their chefs are all off because of the national holiday, otherwise they should work on finding new cooks. Worst of all, though, was the coffee. It was a mix between a Vietnamese coffee and a very, very watery Americano. We were looking for somewhere to eat that could do both local and Western food, but this place does neither.\nRead more\nWritten February 3, 2019",
