            "review_text": "Jesse122\nLong Beach, California11 contributions\n0\nDon’t waste your time\nOct 2018 • Solo\nI just wanted a quick snack. I walked by this place the night before it was pretty full so I decided to stop in the next day. I ordered their pub chips (French Fries) that say on the menu come with gravy and curry sauce. Well the fries arrived with a bottle of ketchup. I tried to get the waitresses attention as she played on her phone but no luck. So I got up and asked about the gravy and curry sauce. She said ok. I sat and waited about 5 min while she continued to play on her phone then came over and told me no. So I ate my cold French fries with hot sauce 🙁\nRead more\nWritten October 16, 2018",
